"┌─────────────────────────[ Issue Creation Contract ]──────────────────────────┐"
"│Maestro issues are execution contracts. Write the smallest useful unit an     │"
"│agent can ship, test, and review.                                             │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│1. Classify the work as feature or bug so the right DOR fields appear.        │"
"│2. Describe expected behavior, acceptance criteria, files, and test hints.    │"
"│3. Connect blockers so the queue respects sequencing instead of guessing.     │"
"│4. Review the final markdown before it is sent to GitHub.                     │"
"│                                                                              │"
